abstract: "[TR ONLY] 1/5000 Master Plan (NIP) population, MPYY standards, DOP/land readjustment, urban morphology, and network analytics studio designed for Turkish urban planning studios. Version 1.2.0 adds trend and cohort-component population projection, neighbourhood allocation and a vulnerability index; these features were rewritten on the basis of Kent Öngörü v1.0.0 by Berkay Memiş (GPL-2.0-or-later). The numerator/denominator vulnerability method comes from the PLN3113 studio."
